        "content": "Use this as the incident first screen.\n\n1. Check HTTP RED first: traffic, 5xx rate, and p95 latency.\n2. If errors rise, split caller-visible 4xx from server-side 5xx before debugging storage or provider paths.\n3. Check DB USE to confirm whether latency is local storage saturation.\n4. Runtime CPU, memory, goroutines, GC, and file descriptors live in the runtime dashboard.\n5. Security/audit evidence and cleanup health live in the dedicated security dashboard.",
